    {
      "key": "tf424fba1d89eab7d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A swap-free label may address overnight interest but not every Sharia question. Review the legal and fee structure, check current</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">account types</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">, and consult a qualified Islamic-finance scholar familiar with the product.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">免掉期标签可以解决隔夜利息，但不能解决所有伊斯兰教法问题。查看法律和费用结构，检查当前</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">账户类型</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">，并咨询熟悉该产品的合格伊斯兰金融学者。</span>"
    },
