    {
      "key": "td850c8a6aca0fd08",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is the difference between leverage and margin?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆和保证金有什么区别？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta02bd09b0056838f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage is the ratio between a position’s notional value and the margin required to support it. Margin is the account equity reserved for that position. Higher leverage reduces required margin for the same position, but the market exposure and monetary effect of a price move remain unchanged.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆是头寸的名义价值与支持该头寸所需的保证金之间的比率。保证金是为该头寸保留的账户净值。较高的杠杆率会降低相同头寸所需的保证金，但价格变动的市场风险和货币影响保持不变。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t554d2871809d49e5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What happens when you get a margin call?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">收到追加保证金通知时会发生什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc9dec5a21e8079c0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A margin call means equity has fallen to the broker’s defined margin threshold. The account has limited capacity to support open positions. Depending on the broker and platform, the trader may need to reduce exposure or add funds. If equity falls further, automatic stop-out liquidation may begin.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">追加保证金意味着净值已跌至经纪商规定的保证金阈值。该账户支持未平仓头寸的能力有限。根据经纪商和平台的不同，交易者可能需要减少风险敞口或增加资金。如果净值进一步下跌，可能会开始自动平仓。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2acfcde0595d8498",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is leverage trading halal?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆交易是否清真？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8308f393ef16456d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Its permissibility depends on the complete contract and how the trade is structured. Interest, swaps, loan conditions, ownership, derivatives, uncertainty, and speculation may all affect the assessment. A swap-free feature alone may not settle every issue, so consult a qualified Islamic-finance scholar.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">其允许性取决于完整的合同以及交易的结构。利息、掉期、贷款条件、所有权、衍生品、不确定性和投机都可能影响评估。仅靠免掉期功能可能无法解决所有问题，因此请咨询合格的伊斯兰金融学者。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t307ba3b8a7bf5be6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How do I calculate the margin required for a trade?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何计算交易所需的保证金？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t32d9d9f609961e1c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Divide the position’s notional value by the leverage ratio. A $100,000 position at 1:100 leverage requires approximately $1,000 in margin before broker-specific calculations and trading costs. Some instruments use different contract sizes or margin methods, so confirm the platform specification.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">将头寸的名义价值除以杠杆比率。在 1:100 杠杆下，100,000 美元的头寸需要大约 1,000 美元的保证金，不考虑经纪商特定的计算和交易成本。某些工具使用不同的合约规模或保证金方法，因此请确认平台规格。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfa722de65c8f9efe",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is a stop-out level?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是强制平仓水平？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcb2b59a3e3de61f5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stop-out level is the margin threshold at which a trading system may begin closing open positions automatically to reduce exposure. UpForex’s current account page lists a 30% stop-out level. The exact liquidation sequence and calculations may depend on the platform and open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-leverage-and-margin-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">强制平仓水平是交易系统可以开始自动平仓以减少风险的保证金阈值。 UpForex 的当前账户页面列出了 30% 的强制平仓水平。确切的清算顺序和计算可能取决于平台和未平仓头寸。</span>"
    },
