    },
    {
      "key": "t633ce628baa591e0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The main error is choosing position size without understanding used margin, free margin, or total exposure across several trades.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">主要错误是在不了解多笔交易的已用保证金、可用保证金或总风险敞口的情况下选择头寸规模。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1b18a5c8e7eb1a30",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Consider all correlated positions together.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">将所有相关位置放在一起考虑。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t374f3eac8723a6da",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Check how much free margin would remain after opening the position instead of looking only at the required deposit.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">检查开仓后剩余多少可用保证金，而不是只看所需的保证金。</span>"
    },
    {
