    {
      "key": "t8715ef53807fa937",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Searches for the </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">best forex traders in Dubai</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> often reflect a wider need for a trustworthy trading environment. Dubai forex traders should review the broker’s legal entity, disclosures,</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">account types</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">, and whether it is</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"7\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"8\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"9\">a broker with proper fund protection</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"10\">. The linked guide explains factors traders can review when assessing broker safeguards. </span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/top-10-mistakes-new-forex-traders-make"
      ],
